---
import Pattern from "../Pattern.astro";
import T from "../T.astro";
---

<!-- P1 · The base skeleton: CRUD API (L1) -->
<Pattern
  id="p1"
  num="P1"
  lvl={1}
  titlePt={`O esqueleto base: API CRUD`}
  titleEn={`The base skeleton: CRUD API`}
  kickerPt={`Muitos designs CRUD começam aqui. Em escala modesta, isso pode ser
            suficiente.`}
  kickerEn={`Many CRUD designs start here. At modest scale, this may be
            sufficient.`}
  tipPt={`<strong>Fale enquanto desenha:</strong> "Quando preciso de várias
              instâncias, o load balancer distribui tráfego e verifica saúde.
              Estado compartilhado fora da API deixa qualquer instância atender
              qualquer pedido; adicionar instâncias escala o tier da API."`}
  tipEn={`<strong>Say while drawing:</strong> "When multiple instances are
              needed, the load balancer distributes traffic and checks health.
              Shared state outside the API makes instances interchangeable;
              adding instances scales the API tier."`}
  whyPt={`<strong>Por quê:</strong> <em>LB</em> distribui tráfego e remove
              instâncias sem saúde. <em>API stateless</em> simplifica escala e
              failover; afinidade de sessão existe, mas cria acoplamento com uma
              instância. <em>Um Postgres só</em> porque em L1 pode bastar —
              ACID, chato, confiável. Dizer "ainda não preciso de mais" também é
              uma decisão de design.`}
  whyEn={`<strong>Why:</strong> <em>LB</em> distributes traffic and removes
              unhealthy instances. A <em>stateless API</em> simplifies scaling
              and failover; session affinity exists, but couples a client to an
              instance. <em>One Postgres</em> may be enough at L1 — ACID,
              boring, reliable. Saying "I don't need more yet" is also a design
              decision.`}
>
  <Fragment slot="dia" set:html={`<svg
              viewBox="0 0 720 170"
              width="100%"
              style="min-width: 620px"
              role="img"
              aria-labelledby="p1t"
            >
              <title
                id="p1t"
                data-pt="Cliente → Load Balancer → API ×N → banco de dados"
                data-en="Client → Load Balancer → API ×N → database"
              >
                CRUD skeleton
              </title>
              <defs>
                <marker
                  id="m1"
                  markerWidth="8"
                  markerHeight="8"
                  refX="6"
                  refY="3"
                  orient="auto"
                >
                  <path d="M0,0 L0,6 L7,3 z" fill="#8b6ff7" />
                </marker>
              </defs>
              <g font-family="Space Grotesk" font-size="13" font-weight="700">
                <rect
                  x="20"
                  y="60"
                  width="90"
                  height="50"
                  rx="10"
                  fill="#211d33"
                  stroke="#2dd4bf"
                />
                <text
                  x="65"
                  y="89"
                  fill="#2dd4bf"
                  text-anchor="middle"
                  data-pt="Cliente"
                  data-en="Client"
                >
                  Cliente
                </text>
                <rect
                  x="180"
                  y="60"
                  width="90"
                  height="50"
                  rx="10"
                  fill="#211d33"
                  stroke="#fbbf24"
                />
                <text x="225" y="89" fill="#fbbf24" text-anchor="middle">
                  LB
                </text>
                <rect
                  x="340"
                  y="60"
                  width="100"
                  height="50"
                  rx="10"
                  fill="#211d33"
                  stroke="#8b6ff7"
                />
                <text
                  x="390"
                  y="89"
                  fill="#8b6ff7"
                  text-anchor="middle"
                  data-pt="API ×N"
                  data-en="API ×N"
                >
                  API ×N
                </text>
                <rect
                  x="570"
                  y="60"
                  width="110"
                  height="50"
                  rx="10"
                  fill="#2a1207"
                  stroke="#f59e0b"
                />
                <text x="625" y="89" fill="#fbbf24" text-anchor="middle">
                  Postgres
                </text>
              </g>
              <g
                stroke="#8b6ff7"
                stroke-width="2"
                fill="none"
                marker-end="url(#m1)"
              >
                <path d="M110 85 H180" />
                <path d="M270 85 H340" />
                <path d="M440 85 H570" />
              </g>
              <text
                x="505"
                y="75"
                font-family="Space Grotesk"
                font-size="11"
                fill="#9ea2b8"
                text-anchor="middle"
                data-pt="ler + gravar"
                data-en="read + write"
              >
                ler + gravar
              </text>
            </svg>`} />
  <ol slot="order">
    <Fragment set:html={`<li>`} />
    <T pt={`Cliente (caixa à esquerda)`} en={`Client (box on the left)`} />
    <Fragment set:html={`</li>
<li>LB</li>
<li>`} />
    <T pt={`API ×N (diga "stateless")`} en={`API ×N (say "stateless")`} />
    <Fragment set:html={`</li>
<li>`} />
    <T pt={`Postgres`} en={`Postgres`} />
    <Fragment set:html={`</li>
<li>`} />
    <T pt={`Setas: cliente → LB → API → DB`} en={`Arrows: client → LB → API → DB`} />
    <Fragment set:html={`</li>`} />
  </ol>
</Pattern>
